  {
    "name": "structural_checks",
    "title": "Structural model with problems",
    "group": "Structure",
    "description": "A small steel frame with deliberate faults, each labelled in the Level 2 plan, for Analyze › Checks › Check Supports and Check Consistency to find: a floating ring of beams, a beam resting on nothing, a member 40 mm short of a column, members framing mid-span with no node, a girder moved off its analytical line, a beam with no analytical member, a member pinned at both ends and a slab well below its beams. The ring's beams, the moved girder and the cantilever also overlap where they meet (left on purpose).",
